WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=zu.

1
00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:06.706
Le vidiyo ibonisa indlela yokuhlola izibuko eziseduze nokukhipha izibuko.

2
00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.014
Geza izandla bese ufaka iPPE.

3
00:00:09.014 --> 00:00:16.706
Uzodinga ishadi lokubuka eduze, ipeni kanye namanothi omtholampilo, izibuko zokufunda kanye nentambo engu-40cm ubude.

4
00:00:16.706 --> 00:00:19.783
Chaza ukuthi uzokwenzani ngemvume engaphakathi kwegeyimu.

5
00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:22.860
Hlalisa isiguli ngokunethezeka endaweni ekhanyiswe kahle.

6
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:28.629
Sebenzisa intambo ukuze uqiniseke ukuthi ishadi ligcinwe ebangeni elifanele elingu-40cm.

7
00:00:28.629 --> 00:00:32.860
Bacele ukuthi bafunde phansi ishadi ngamehlo womabili ndawonye.

8
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.200
umugqa omncane abangawufunda ngokukhululeka.

9
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.100
Uma bengakwazi ukufunda ulayini we-N8 bese uzama ngawo

10
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.371
kanye nezingilazi eziyi-1.5 diopter sphere.

11
00:00:41.371 --> 00:00:46.820
Uma bengasakwazi ukufunda i-N8 bese besebenzisa amandla aphezulu alandelayo

12
00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.242
nokunye baze bakwazi ukufunda ngokunethezeka umbhalo we-N8.

13
00:00:50.242 --> 00:00:52.980
Qinisekisa ukuthi izibuko zilingana kahle futhi

14
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.980
isiguli sijabule ngokubukeka kwabo.
